**Investigation Complete - Summary**

**The Bug**

Colors appear overexposed at 100% brightness in Electron 40 OSR (not at 99%)

**Root Cause**

OS reports HDR/wide-gamut color spaces at 100% brightness even for SDR content

**The Fix**

```
// shell/browser/osr/osr_render_widget_host_view.cc:980-987
} else {
  gfx::DisplayColorSpaces srgb_display_color_spaces{
      gfx::ColorSpace::CreateSRGB(), viz::SinglePlaneFormat::kRGBA_8888};
  screen_info.display_color_spaces = srgb_display_color_spaces;
}
```

